[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Layout Principles[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m#### Spacing System[m
[32m+[m[32m- Base unit: 4px[m
[32m+[m[32m- Common spacing values: 8px, 16px, 24px, 32px, 48px, 64px[m
[32m+[m[32m- Consistent padding within components[m
[32m+[m[32m- Generous margins between sections[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m#### Grid System[m
[32m+[m[32m- 12-column responsive grid[m
[32m+[m[32m- Maximum content width: 1200px[m
[32m+[m[32m- Mobile-first approach[m
[32m+[m[32m- Breakpoints:[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Mobile: < 576px[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Tablet: 576px - 768px[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Desktop: > 768px[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m#### Page Structure[m
[32m+[m[32m1. **Clean Header**: Logo left, navigation center/right, minimal height[m
[32m+[m[32m2. **Hero Sections**: Large typography, clear value proposition, single CTA[m
[32m+[m[32m3. **Content Sections**: Card-based layouts with clear separation[m
[32m+[m[32m4. **Footer**: Organized link groups, subdued styling[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Implementation Guidelines[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m#### CSS Architecture[m
[32m+[m[32m- Use CSS custom properties for theme values[m
[32m+[m[32m- Implement utility classes for common patterns[m
[32m+[m[32m- Maintain component-based styling[m
[32m+[m[32m- Follow BEM or similar naming convention[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m#### Accessibility[m
[32m+[m[32m- WCAG 2.1 AA compliance minimum[m
[32m+[m[32m- Proper color contrast ratios (4.5:1 for normal text, 3:1 for large text)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Keyboard navigation support[m
[32m+[m[32m- Screen reader friendly markup[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m#### Performance[m
[32m+[m[32m- Optimize for Core Web Vitals[m
[32m+[m[32m- Lazy load images and non-critical resources[m
[32m+[m[32m- Minimize CSS and JavaScript bundles[m
[32m+[m[32m- Use system fonts to reduce load time[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Example Implementation[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe password reset page (as shown in the screenshot) exemplifies our design principles:[m
[32m+[m[32m- Clean, centered card layout with ample whitespace[m
[32m+[m[32m- Clear typography hierarchy (heading, body text, labels)[m
