[32m+[m[32m- Professional, trustworthy appearance[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Design Review Checklist[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mBefore implementing any UI component, ensure it meets these criteria:[m
[32m+[m[32m- [ ] Does it serve a clear functional purpose?[m
[32m+[m[32m- [ ] Is the visual hierarchy obvious?[m
[32m+[m[32m- [ ] Are interactive elements clearly indicated?[m
[32m+[m[32m- [ ] Does it maintain consistency with existing components?[m
[32m+[m[32m- [ ] Is the color usage restrained and meaningful?[m
[32m+[m[32m- [ ] Are accessibility requirements met?[m
[32m+[m[32m- [ ] Does it work well on mobile devices?[m
[32m+[m[32m- [ ] Is the code clean and maintainable?[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Future Considerations[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAs the platform evolves, maintain these design principles while:[m
[32m+[m[32m- Adapting to new user needs and feedback[m
[32m+[m[32m- Incorporating modern web technologies[m
[32m+[m[32m- Ensuring consistency across all touchpoints[m
[32m+[m[32m- Balancing innovation with familiarity[m
